## Service Architecture

[3–5 sentences describing the service design. Example:]

```
Core API service handling driver allocation, mission management, and account/invoice processing.
Requests are parsed and validated via Form Requests, then routed to the Service layer.
Services orchestrate business logic; all database access is via Eloquent through Repositories.
Real-time location updates flow through Socket.IO (Node.js) and are batched into MySQL via Redis.
Soft-delete is enforced for all auditable entities.
```

