- `app/Http/Controllers/[Main].php` — HTTP routing, request parsing, Form Request validation
- `app/Services/[Main].php` — Business logic orchestration (no direct DB queries)
- `app/Repositories/[Main].php` — All database access via Eloquent
- `app/Models/[Main].php` — Eloquent model definitions, relations, scopes

Layers and their purpose (abbreviated — full conventions in `laravel-patterns.md`):
- `app/Http/Controllers/` → Request parsing, validation (Form Requests), route to service
- `app/Services/` → Business logic orchestration; no raw DB queries
- `app/Repositories/` → All Eloquent DB access
- `app/Models/` → Model definitions, relations, scopes

