If this stack is currently classified mandatory-supported, `setup.sh` and `setup-repos.sh` hard-fail when the graph cannot be installed/built and this section MUST NOT be deleted. If classified weak or candidate, the graph runs best-effort and any output is auto-prefixed `[INTELLISENSE-WEAK-STACK: <stack> — <reason>]`.

